# Except small example files
!example_*.csv

# Except the small inputs the Paper-1 pipeline needs to run from a clone, and the
# small result tables a reader may want without running anything. The 12 MB
# property table and the two large regenerable outputs (screen_full.csv,
# genuine_osc_ranked.csv) stay Zenodo-only; see
# paper1_opv_screening/data/README_DATA.txt.
!paper1_opv_screening/data/ASTMG173.csv
!paper1_opv_screening/data/reorganization_energies_corrected.csv
!paper1_opv_screening/viable_view_a_metric.csv
!paper1_opv_screening/viable_view_b_stability_screened.csv
!paper1_opv_screening/reorganization_energies.csv

